  "notes": "FORMS:\n{思|おも}い (thought) + がけ (expectation) + ず (negation)\n\nLiterally 'without expecting.'\n- {思|おも}いがけない - unexpected (adjective)\n- {思|おも}いがけなく - unexpectedly (adverb form)\n\nREGISTER:\nNeutral to slightly formal. Literary flavor.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {意外|いがい}と/{案外|あんがい} - unexpectedly (focuses on result being different than expected)\n- たまたま - by chance, coincidentally\n- ふと - suddenly, casually (for thoughts or actions)",
